{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Elements are tested in index order, 0 nearest the root. The table never holds two vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that test the same element with the same children, nor a vertex whose high child is the empty"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"family, so each family has one vertex: two "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/Family","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" values are equal exactly when they hold"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same sets. An element no set of a family contains never appears in its diagram, which keeps"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the diagrams of sparse families small."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["var diagram = ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram(elementCount: 3)","let f = diagram.family([[0, 1], [1, 2], [2]])","diagram.count(of: f)                                  \/\/ 3","let g = diagram.including(2, in: f)                   \/\/ {{1, 2}, {2}}","diagram.minimalSets(of: g) == diagram.family([[2]])   \/\/ true","diagram.join(diagram.single(0), g)                    \/\/ {{0, 1, 2}, {0, 2}}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Families are built by the mutating methods, which add vertices to the table and leave every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"existing family as it was; a family belongs to the table it was built in and its copies. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"table keeps every vertex it has made."}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams"]]},"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/Family","doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/GraphView-swift.struct","doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/SetsView"],"anchor":"Structures","generated":true,"title":"Structures"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/init(elementCount:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/elementCount","doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/empty","doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/graphView-swift.property","doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/tableVertexCount","doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/unit"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/contains(_:in:)","doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/count(of:)","doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/excluding(_:in:)","doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/family(_:)","doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams\/documentation\/DecisionDiagrams\/ZeroSuppressedDecisionDiagram\/including(_:in:)","doc:\/\/DecisionDiagrams